  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society for Inclusiveness, Democracy and Human Rights</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civilsamh&#xe4;lle f&#xf6;r inkludering, demokrati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1)&#xa0; MR-organisationer st&#xe4;rker sina finansiella, tekniska och organisationella kapaciteter f&#xf6;r att b&#xe4;ttra kunna fr&#xe4;mja m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Palestina.

2) MR-organisationer &#xe4;r mer proaktiva och responsiva in deras fr&#xe4;mjande av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, transparens och ansvarighet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)&#xa0;Human Rights Civil Society Organizations have strengthened financial, technical and organizational capacities to better advocate for Palestinian human rights.

2) Human Rights Civil Society Organizations are jointly more proactive and responsive in their promotion of human rights, gender equality and transparency &amp; accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: Human Rights Civil Society Organizations have strengthened financial, technical and organizational capacities to better advocate for Palestinian human rights. 

Output 2: Human Rights Civil Society Organizations are jointly more proactive and responsive in their promotion of  human rights, gender equality and transparency &amp; accountability</narrative>
  </description>
